g printed notes for the design patterns.&#13;&#10;Got a good idea about how the insdustrial coding will done.&#13;&#10;Course conducted in well speed so that everyone can understand. So I think I got many concepts covered in class very well.&#13;&#10;Gave useful examples&#13;&#10;Without any argument CS20xx is the best module in this semester. Module content was well structured and content was delivered very clearly and in understandable manner. Dr. Marcia is very talented and her way of teaching is what any student expect from a lecturer.     Content is very interesting to learn and work load is very satisfied. Rather than just byhearting we could learn something from this module. Lecturer always encouraged us to understand the theory rather than remembering word by word.    Lecture slides are very satisfied. We can read and understand lot of things from the slides.     Practicals and Labs were very satisfied.. Giving example codes and references helped us to learn.    Semester project is also very good opportunity to us to learn lot.     Evaluating, getting feedback helped the module to become student friendly and more effective for learning.&#13;&#10;providing example codes .  providing lecture notes.  &#13;&#10;easy to learn&#13;&#10;Day after the lecture there was practicals which tested the knowledge gained during the lecture&#13;&#10;Discussing answers for the practicals was good and uploading sample codes for concepts discussed in the class to the moodle was really helping.&#13;&#10;Examples were discussed and practicals were scheduled to enhance the learning. The lecturer took an effort in delivering the subject content&#13;&#10;Good explanations for concepts and examples.    Useful practical sessions.&#13;&#10;homeworks given in each week  Examples discussed in lectures  Allow us to do alone the problems in the lecture&#13;&#10;We learnt oosd concept in a proper way since lab practicals.&#13;&#10;practical session and home work given helps to develop our k