er for them are very useful to analyse myself.&#13;&#10;homeworks are given weekly and answers are given us in the end of the week. that helps us to clear our questions.&#13;&#10;in class activites are helpful to understand concepts better.  &#13;&#10;Here we got better learning expirience with asking question and compairing example answers.&#13;&#10;Well structured module.  Since every week we have to practically apply the concepts we learnt from the lecture, we can have a good understanding about the concepts.  Since individual feedback for homework is given it is easy to understand what are the concepts we do not know clearly.  Most of the workshops organized for programming challenge 1 are very useful for us to develop our projects.&#13;&#10;Well structured exercises and slides.&#13;&#10;Giving inclass activities and homework each week is really good as it help us to keep in with what is taught.This module requires more self studies than waht is taught.Tempting student to do such work can be seen as a positive aspect.&#13;&#10;more activities and the lecturer submit answers to those activities making it easier to understand&#13;&#10;The home work assignments and practicals are very useful for us to understand the concepts well. It is a great help for us that you talk to each and every group and correct our errors.&#13;&#10;discussing examples in the class itself helped to get a better understanding&#13;&#10;individual feedback given while practical time is good. also concepts explains well during lectures&#13;&#10;The in class and homework let me evaluate myself and gain better understanding&#13;&#10;Lot of inclass activities test my knowledge then and there&#13;&#10;There were more inclass and homework activities done.&#13;&#10;We could improve our knowledge and experience about developing quality software.  The different models we were taught helped a lot.&#13;&#10;Giving homework and evaluating them is very useful.  Discussing many examples is helpful to understand things.&#13;&#10;Giving sample answers for all the questions  Discussing those in the class  In the lab classes, we can clarify things with the support of TAs&#13;&#10;In-class activities and home-works were very helpful to understand the module's contents. Also our lecturer gave us advises to learn effectively in the class room.&#13;&#10;Much more practical stuff like we had to go to some institutions in order to get the information from the users and analyse their existing systems.   Team work is enhanced. To make sure that everyone in the team is over the line.&#13;&#10;clearly explain theory using problem and give a sample answer&#13;&#10;We successfully archived each and every lesson outcome as we have to do a exercise which needed to be submit on the next day. Also it got well improved by discussing every problem in the next class.&#13;&#10;The lectures were well-organized and clearly presented.  The content of the course was fascinating&#13;&#10;Explanations and presentations were good.&#13;&#10;It is easy to study as seniors are helping us in practicals&#13;&#10;doing home works and in class activities are really helping a lot.&#13;&#10;Lab session is very useful for improve our knowledge of diagram.&#13;&#10;Sometimes it was easy to understand with doing activities.&#13;&#10;resolved many examples in class and gave answers next week. It help to find our errors and learn. And the difference I see this semester and last semester now we are in touch with this module. Last semester it was not happen.&#13;&#10;It is good that we have lab exercises relating to that week's content every week.&#13;&#10;Letting us to do in class exercises were very helpful to grasp the concepts that were taught. Assigning homework and giving feedback on practicals were also very helpful.&#13;&#10;The way the activities are conducted is good&#13;&#10;Explaining lectures by doing activities &amp; explaining them is very good. And also we can ask questions in the lecture. It is 